WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.060
The test is getting clooooser.

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.360
Too much happens at this school!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:37.240
The only things on the test will be
things we learned in claaaass.

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:41.530
"Episode 4: Pinch! Test of Learning"

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.120
Can you...

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.000
Can you fail the test?

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.170
D-Don't worry, Lord Ains!

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:51.090
That's right!

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:55.260
We guardians would never fail such a test.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.220
G-Good.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:00.050
You may be worried about Shalltear,

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.720
but she's still a guardian of Nazarick!

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:04.970
She'll pass this test easily!

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.640
Th-That's right!

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.770
There's some things I
may not be very good at,

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:12.860
but I promise, I promise I'll
live up to your expectations!

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:14.780
G-Good.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.320
I just asked because I'm worried I'll fail.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:20.660
I'm not worried about a thing.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:24.200
But I'm curious what effect
it will have on the world.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.330
I asked to confirm that.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.960
Some of us are doubtless
very bad at taking tests!

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.500
You were looking at me, weren't you?

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.670
You think I'm an idiot?

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.710
I'm giving you a pass on being an undead,

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:38.090
--so why are you treating me like that?
--No, that's not it.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.130
No, I'm not letting this slide!

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:41.140
Let's compete!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.760
Let's compete to see who gets
a better score on the test!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.720
That's not good! Not good at all!

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:48.270
I never even graduated middle school!

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.270
But everybody's looking at me!

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.480
What do I do? What do I do?

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.190
I know...

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:00.400
You're quite certain about this?

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:01.700
Yup! I am!

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.530
It didn't work!

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.490
I see.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:09.000
What did you get out of that?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.580
Challenging Ains to a competition?
How stupid are you?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:13.790
But he...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:17.420
Unlike you, he pays attention in class.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.880
Did you really think you could win?

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:22.510
And for your part, your INT stat is
lower than anybody would suspect,

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.640
and it isn't going up.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.520
You don't need to tell me like that!

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:29.560
--You're such a meanie!

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:32.140
--At this point it's not even a competition,
--You're such a meanie!

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:35.560
so study hard enough that
you don't embarrass yourself.

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.690
Wonderful!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:41.740
I welcome you to my 203rd Aerial Mage
Battalion's famous studying curriculum!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.530
I'm sorry. Please no.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.120
I have complete confidence in
my ability to train in a short time!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.780
It's jam-packed with things to do,

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:50.200
--and you can even get a promotion--
--I'm sorry. Please no.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.620
Can I go to sleep?

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:56.920
I don't get sleepy in this
world, but I'm bored.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:57.250
"Quiet in the studying room!"

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.090
No you can't, student Puck.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:01.050
Work hard.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.720
You're doing perfect, Subaru!

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.220
I'm so impressed!

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.220
Thanks!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.760
This brings back memories.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:12.770
I studied with both of you like this.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:13.640
"Quiet in the studying room!"

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:14.520
That's right.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.190
Yes.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.690
Studied with both of you?

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:22.690
When?

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:27.030
When did I study with them?

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:29.700
How long have we been here?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.200
"No Talking in the Studying Room"

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.660
Is something wrong?

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.670
It's nothing.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.920
--Thinking probably won't
help you find the answer.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.460
--Subaru? Subaru?
--Thinking probably won't
help you find the answer.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:43.670
"Quiet in the studying room!"

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.180
Sorry, sorry. I was just thinking.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.010
You surprised me by shuttin'
yer trap like that.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:49.100
Nobody says "shuttin' yer trap."

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:52.060
"No Talking in the Studying Room"

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:53.850
Let's move on.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.140
Yes. Let's.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.650
Oui, oui. Roger that!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.440
"Class 1"

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:00.730
So this is what happens here.

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.320
I don't get it!

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.530
Hey, Chris!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:06.990
Kazuma!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.820
I have a question.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.370
Can you help Aqua study?

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.500
It's bro's friend's bro!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.290
Bro's friend's bro?

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.380
Just call me Kazuma.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.340
Anyway, I don't think I've
seen you two together before.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:21.800
Oh, well...

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:24.050
I heard she's a thief.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:27.550
I was something similar, so we get along.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:30.390
By the way, Kazuma here is an adventurer,

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.100
but I've given him my skills,

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.270
so he actually has thief abilities, too.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.770
Wow.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.440
What've you stolen?

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.520
Chris's panties.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.730
You didn't need to say that!

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:45.490
Hey, weren't we supposed
to be helping me study?

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:49.490
Okay, time to start the teeeeest!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:54.750
These problems were written
by Mr. Pandora's Actor.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.000
Oh, right.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.370
If you get caught cheating, you get a zero.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.540
So no cheating.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.630
Who does paper tests anymore?

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.460
Is it just to see if we've
been paying attention?

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.380
They must not think much of us.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:10.430
I'm sure Ains agrees.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.680
Tanya's looking at me.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.720
The way she looks at me...

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.220
It hurts how much she
thinks too highly of me!

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:18.440
No stealing other people's answer sheets.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.520
Gulp!

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.940
Did you just hear somebody say "gulp"?

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.150
N-Nope!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.190
Kazuma wouldn't do that.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.490
He may not be as smart as
a Crimson Demon like me,

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.820
but he's still very intelligent.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:35.410
He can get a good grade
just by taking the test normally.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.330
Are you actually competent?

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.120
No, not really...

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:43.290
It seems I underestimated you.

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:44.750
My apologies.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:48.170
I won't tell her that I was
planning on stealing her answers.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:52.390
I just heard the sound of somebody's
conscience aching behind me...

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.180
Well, I didn't!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:05.690
Okay, begin the teeeeeeest!

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:14.870
I spent the whole week relearning
what I learnt in elementary school.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.200
But I don't know a single answer.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.790
Pandora's Actor, why did you
make these so hard?!

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:25.130
Well, I would too if I was
the one giving the questions.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.290
Oh, fine.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:29.710
I'll have to get a good score
even if it means cheating.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:34.970
I hate to do it, but I'll use
the level 11 magic, Time Stop.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.220
And cheat.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.010
Time Stop.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.810
Now, time to look at everyone's answers.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.350
What's happening?

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.940
Everybody froze!

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.190
Poke! Poke!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.480
Hello?

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:52.860
That's right! Aqua counts as a god!

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.910
She can move even when time's stopped?

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.490
Lucky me!

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:59.160
Show me your answers, Kazuma!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.870
--Wait, I can't see them from this angle.
--When I see somebody else doing it,

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.540
I realize that it's not good to do.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.880
She's a goddess and I'm undead.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.460
But I'm ashamed at myself
for trying to cheat.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.460
But what do I do?

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.220
I'm the one who stopped time.

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:14.760
Is this your doing?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:17.550
No. I don't have this power.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:18.390
I see.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:21.390
It seems you're not Being X then.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.350
That's what I've been saying.

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:26.860
That aside, what the hell are you doing?

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:32.990
You're a brave girl,
cheating right in front of me.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:35.030
No! No, I...!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.200
No talking!

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.990
Why can Tanya move, too?

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:39.830
No, wait.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:44.870
Tanya said she was brought to another world
by a being that called itself a god.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:48.710
It's possible that someone
capable of conversing with a god

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:50.250
could be immune to Time Stop.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.090
Maybe?

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.090
Hey.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.300
Tanya, Aqua, we're in the middle of a test.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.090
Calm down.

00:08:56.090 --> 00:09:00.010
Wait, aren't the other guys
concentrating a little too hard?

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.970
Huh? They're not breathing?

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.930
Hey, what's going on?

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.230
Wait, Subaru can move, too?

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:10.480
In my world, barely anybody
can even use level 11 magic!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.110
But it doesn't work on all these people?

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.240
This world's really scary!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.610
I'll stop the spell before someone finds out.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.490
What? What happened?

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:24.870
What are you doooooing?

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.290
It's kind of hard to breathe...

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.790
<i>Pencils?</i>

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:32.420
Aqua?

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:36.680
Go stand in the hallway.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.800
Why?

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.640
Sorry, Aqua.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.980
I filled in the answers I knew, but...

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:55.400
You be quiet, too, Ains!

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.870
I'm passing back the tests!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:29.000
Knowing Pandora's Actor's personality,
I thought it might work.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.160
But I didn't expect...

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:34.460
...this to really be the answers.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:38.800
It was insulting to test Lord Ains like this.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:40.840
It worked out okay, though.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.550
Ains is amazing!

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:47.390
Of course! He is omnipotent,
all knowing! A great being!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:52.190
It really did work out okay, though...
